# Root .gitignore — repo-wide safety net. Each Vite app (reroll/, tagger/) also
# has its own .gitignore for node_modules/ and dist/; these entries back them up
# and catch any future app dir.

# Dependencies / build output
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.local
.idea/
.vscode/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Hand-drawn reference art. Read by the analysis scripts and cited by
# docs/AUTOTILE_PATTERN_BAKE.md, but deliberately out of version control.
assets/
